                  <num>4</num>
                  <heading>Paragraph 159GZZZZG(1)(d)</heading>
                  <content>
                    <p>Omit “30% of the IB amounts”, substitute “all of the IB amounts multiplied by the corporate tax rate”.</p>
                  </content>
                </hcontainer>
                <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-2__dvs-1__amdact-2__item-2">
