                    <p>Insert:</p>
                  </content>
                  <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__part-2__dvs-1__amdact-3__item-6__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                    <subsection eId="schedule-1__part-2__dvs-1__amdact-3__item-6__qstr-1__subsec-3A">
                      <num>3A</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>In reducing *net exempt income for an income year under subsection (3):</p>
                      </content>
                      <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-2__dvs-1__amdact-3__item-6__qstr-1__subsec-3A__para-a">
                        <num>a</num>
