                          <p>if you were a *small business entity for the year—each 28.5 cents of *tax offset reduces the net exempt income by $1; or</p>
                        </content>
                      </paragraph>
                      <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-2__dvs-1__amdact-3__item-6__qstr-1__subsec-3A__para-b">
                        <num>b</num>
